Package: estrec
Type: Package
Title: Write Estimation Results as 'estimation' Records
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("estimation-format authors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "jemather@gmail.com")
Description: Writes fitted models as records in the 'estimation' format, a JSON
    file for one statistical estimation run: what was estimated, what came out,
    and how and where it ran. Version 0.1 writes 'fixest' 'feols' fits (OLS and IV,
    including multiple estimations, 'split' and 'subset').
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/estimation-format/estimation
BugReports: https://github.com/estimation-format/estimation/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: jsonlite, stats, utils
Suggests: fixest (>= 0.12)
Encoding: UTF-8
